<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico places 3.906 bln in money mkt.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico places 3.906 bln in money mkt.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banco de Mexico completed all three credit auctions totalling 3.906 billion pesos on the secondary market on Wednesday.</p>
<p>   CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     MAXIMUM  MINIMUM  AVERAGE</p>
<p>   1.053 bln pesos  14 days  25.00    24.88    24.93</p>
<p>   1.053 bln pesos  13 days  24.95    24.78    24.86</p>
<p>   1.800 bln pesos   1 day   24.20    24.00    24.11</p>
<p>The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559</p>
</text>
